# CRUD Map

## 1. CRUD map for all tables

| Table | C | R | U | D | Pages | Who |
|-------|---|---|---|---|-------|-----|
| purok | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | puroks (list + form in one page) | Admin only. Not deleted: residents depend on it. |
| official | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | officials (list + form) | Admin only. Not deleted: approvals refer to it, so it is kept as a record. |
| facility | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | facilities-list, facility-form | Resident: R. Admin: C, R, U. Not deleted: reservations depend on it. |
| equipment_category | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | categories (list + form) | Admin only. Not deleted: equipment depends on it. |
| resident | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | register, residents-list, resident-form | Resident: C, R, U own. Admin: all except delete. Not deleted: reservations and borrowings depend on it. |
| reservation | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | reservations-list, reservation-view, reservation-form | Resident: C, R own, cancel own (status update). Admin: R all, U status (approve or reject). Never deleted, kept as a record. |
| equipment | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | equipment-list, equipment-form | Resident: R. Admin: C, R, U. Not deleted: borrowing history depends on it. |
| equipment_item | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | items-list, item-form | Admin only. Item status is changed to Retired instead of deleting. |
| borrowing | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | borrowings-list, borrowing-view, borrowing-form | Admin: C, R, U (for example the due date). Resident: R own. Never deleted, kept as a record. |
| borrow_item | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | – | borrowing-view, return-form | Admin: C (add items to a borrowing), R, U (record the return and its condition). Never deleted, kept as history. |

## 2. Form fields for my two most important tables

### reservation (page: reservation-form)

| Column | Form control | Required? |
|--------|--------------|-----------|
| reservation_id (UUID) | none, made by the database | no |
| resident_id (foreign key) | `<select>` of resident names, stores the id. For a logged-in resident it is filled in automatically. | yes * |
| facility_id (foreign key) | `<select>` of facility names, stores the id | yes * |
| official_id (foreign key) | not on the Add form. The admin sets it when approving. | no |
| purpose VARCHAR(200) | `<input type="text" maxlength="200">` | yes * |
| start_ts (timestamp) | `<input type="datetime-local">` | yes * |
| end_ts (timestamp) | `<input type="datetime-local">` | yes * |
| status (default 'Pending') | not on the Add form. On the admin Edit page it is a `<select>`: Pending, Approved, Rejected, Cancelled, Completed. | no |

### resident (page: resident-form)

| Column | Form control | Required? |
|--------|--------------|-----------|
| resident_id (UUID) | none, made by the database | no |
| first_name VARCHAR(60) | `<input type="text" maxlength="60">` | yes * |
| last_name VARCHAR(60) | `<input type="text" maxlength="60">` | yes * |
| contact_no VARCHAR(11) | `<input type="tel" maxlength="11" pattern="09[0-9]{9}">` | yes * |
| purok_id (foreign key) | `<select>` of purok names, stores the id | yes * |

